msgid "These instructions explain how to use ArduPilot for the `Bebop2 <https://www.parrot.com/us/drones/parrot-bebop-2?ref=#parrot-bebop-2-details/>`__ on a Linux machine. The Bebop 2 is based on the same architecture as the Bebop with a few noticeable changes, not the least being a much better quality GPS (UBlox GPS with a bigger antenna)."
